OL,3,GNEWSA'Companies shouldn't need a child
OL,4,Ato tell them they're wrong' says girl
OL,5,Aon plastic toys in magazines
OL,6,
OL,7,FCompanies "shouldn't have to be told by
OL,8,Fa 10-year-old" about practices that are
OL,9,Fharmful to the environment, a
OL,10,Fcampaigner has said.
OL,12,FSkye Neville has spent the past six
OL,13,Fyears trying to stop comics coming with
OL,14,Fsingle-use plastic toys.
OL,16,FSkye, 16, was selected from more than
OL,17,F1,000 applicants worldwide to feature
OL,18,Fon the new BBC documentary Climate
OL,19,FChange and Me: Future Council.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
