OL,3,GNEWSA'Companies shouldn't need a child
OL,4,Ato tell them they're wrong' says girl
OL,5,Aon plastic toys in magazines
OL,6,
OL,7,FClimate change has been a reality
OL,8,Fthroughout much of her life - she grew
OL,9,Fup near Fairbourne, the Gwynedd village
OL,10,Fthat made international headlines after
OL,11,Fbeing described as home to some of the
OL,12,FUK's first "climate refugees" as the
OL,13,Farea will be lost to the sea within
OL,14,Fdecades.
